# Strict Structure (mandatory)

## `src/` order

`app` → `components` → `config` → `constants` → `contexts` → `features` → `hooks` → `lib` → `mocks` → `schemas` → `store` → `styles` → `tests` → `types` → `utility`

No new top-level folders. No page logic in `features/`, no Redux store wiring inside route `components/`.

## Feature module file order

`types.ts` → `*Api.ts` → `*Thunks.ts` → `*Slice.ts` → `*Selectors.ts`

Kit demo: `features/demo/item/`. Production handoff: nest under `features/erp/`, `features/lms/`, or `features/configuration/` as agreed with maintainers.

## Route folder order

`page.tsx` → `layout.tsx` → `hooks/` → `components/` → `schemas/` → `utils/`

## Component layer order

`ui/` → `shared/atoms/` → `shared/molecules/` → `shared/organisms/`

Lower layers never import higher. `ui/` never imports `shared/`.

## Data flow

`app` → `hooks` → `features/*Thunks` → `*Api` → `axios`. Never `app` → `*Api` or `shared` → `features`.
